# README

`README.md` is the build guide. Keep new steps in the same short form
as the sections around them.

- Command blocks use a `bash` fence.
- Name the machine with `${MACHINE}` and take the image version from
  the built file name. Do not invent a second version string.
- `dd` writes the whole disk (`/dev/sdX`), not a partition. Tell the
  reader to unmount the card first. The image includes the bootloader.
- USB recovery files go under `openvario/` on the stick. Say that this
  path only works when OpenVario is already installed on the card.
- Point recipe bugs at Openvario/meta-openvario. This README is not the
  issue tracker.
